and Di Leva, A.
and Elekes, Z.
and Fiore, E. M.
and Formicola, A.
and F{\"u}l{\"o}p, Zs.
and Gervino, G.
and Guglielmetti, A.
and Gustavino, C.
and Gy{\"u}rky, G.
and Imbriani, G.
and Junker, M.
and Kievsky, A.
and Kochanek, I.
and Lugaro, M.
and Marcucci, L. E.
and Mangano, G.
